@startuml
title RF48 — Subatributos ampliados, macros e overall por posição · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "OpenSearch 2" as OpenSearch
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
Manager -> Frontend: aba Atributos
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/players/{pid}/attributes
API -> UseCase: GetPlayerAttributesUseCase
UseCase -> MySQL: owner check · Player.attributes · estilos e consumíveis ativos · slot no depth chart
alt não é dono
  API --> Frontend: 403
else senão
  UseCase -> Redis: GET overall-weights:active
  UseCase -> UseCase: MacroCalculator(família) · OverallCalculator(20 posições)
  UseCase --> API: PlayerAttributesDto (grupos, macros, overall por posição, nível)
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Admin -> API: POST /admin/overall-weights {pesos, vetorDeOuro}
API -> UseCase: OverallWeightsAdminUseCase.propose
alt soma ≠ 1 ou vetor de ouro falha
  API --> Admin: 422 WEIGHTS_INVALID
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: OverallWeights DRAFT
  Admin -> API: POST /admin/overall-weights/{v}/activate
  UseCase -> MySQL: ACTIVE · anterior RETIRED
  UseCase -> Scheduler: RecomputeOverallsJob
  Scheduler -> OpenSearch: reindexa overalls
  UseCase -> AuditService: OVERALL_WEIGHTS_ACTIVATED
end
@enduml
